          "explanation": "Read shipment warehouse and set header leading/trailing status to the supplied newSts, actual ship/stamp timestamps to UTC now and status dates to the warehouse-local calendar date. This UPDATE does not repeat the advancing-status guard used by alert insertion.",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "rs-batch-1809753850"
          ]
